{
  "id": "specialNounsNumber",
  "title": "Special Nouns: Singular/Plural",
  "subtitle": "особенные существительные и согласование с is/are",
  "ruleBlocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Как работает правило"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Некоторые английские существительные не подчиняются простому правилу «если есть -s, значит множественное». Поэтому для них важно запоминать категорию: всегда singular (is), всегда plural (are), одинаковая форма (is/are по контексту), или особая форма множественного числа."
    },
    {
      "type": "highlight",
      "title": "База",
      "lines": [
        "is: singular-only nouns и существительные на -s, которые грамматически singular",
        "are: plural-only nouns и обычные формы множественного числа",
        "is / are: слова с одинаковой формой в singular и plural (series, sheep, means и т.д.)",
        "irregular plural: man -> men, child -> children, tooth -> teeth и т.д."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "1) Только singular (обычно is)"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "caption": "Singular-only и похожие случаи",
      "columns": [
        "Группа",
        "Слова",
        "Пример"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Только singular",
          "advice, chess, clothing, furniture, gossip, hair, homework, jewellery, knowledge, money, moustache, news, trouble, information, progress, weather",
          "The news is important. / Her hair is wet."
        ],
        [
          "Слова из тренировки",
          "meat, water, space, speech, work",
          "Work is hard today."
        ],
        [
          "На -s, но singular",
          "mathematics, physics, phonetics, politics, economics, gymnastics, athletics, measles, rickets, mumps",
          "Physics is difficult for me."
        ],
        [
          "Согласование как singular",
          "everyone, everybody",
          "Everybody is ready."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "2) Только plural (обычно are)"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "caption": "Plural-only nouns",
      "columns": [
        "Группа",
        "Слова",
        "Пример"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Только plural",
          "binoculars, clothes, glasses, goods, headphones, outskirts, police, pyjamas, scales, scissors, stairs, thanks, tights, traffic lights, trousers, jeans, shorts",
          "My trousers are new. / The police are here."
        ],
        [
          "Формы множественного числа",
          "people, men, gentlemen, mice, cakes",
          "People are friendly."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "3) Одинаковая форма: singular и plural"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "caption": "Смотри на контекст (this/these, one/many)",
      "columns": [
        "Слово",
        "Singular (is)",
        "Plural (are)"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "series",
          "This series is short.",
          "These series are short."
        ],
        [
          "means",
          "A means is needed.",
          "Different means are possible."
        ],
        [
          "sheep",
          "This sheep is calm.",
          "Those sheep are calm."
        ],
        [
          "species",
          "This species is rare.",
          "These species are rare."
        ],
        [
          "deer",
          "A deer is in the garden.",
          "Deer are in the garden."
        ],
        [
          "fish",
          "This fish is fresh.",
          "Fish are expensive today."
        ],
        [
          "bison",
          "A bison is huge.",
          "Bison are huge."
        ],
        [
          "crossroads",
          "The crossroads is empty at night.",
          "The crossroads are busy in the morning."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "4) Irregular plural"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "caption": "Особые формы множественного числа",
      "columns": [
        "Singular",
        "Plural",
        "Пример"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "man",
          "men",
          "Two men are waiting."
        ],
        [
          "woman",
          "women",
          "Women are welcome."
        ],
        [
          "child",
          "children",
          "The children are outside."
        ],
        [
          "person",
          "people",
          "People are tired."
        ],
        [
          "goose",
          "geese",
          "Geese are noisy."
        ],
        [
          "tooth",
          "teeth",
          "Your teeth are white."
        ],
        [
          "foot",
          "feet",
          "My feet are cold."
        ],
        [
          "mouse",
          "mice",
          "Mice are small."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "highlight",
      "title": "Короткий алгоритм",
      "lines": [
        "Шаг 1: проверь, не из списка ли это singular-only (money, news, advice...) -> is",
        "Шаг 2: проверь, не из списка ли это plural-only (trousers, scissors, police...) -> are",
        "Шаг 3: если форма одинаковая (series, means, sheep, species...), смотри на контекст: this/one -> is, these/many -> are",
        "Шаг 4: отдельно учи irregular plural: men, women, children, people, geese, teeth, feet, mice"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "examples",
      "items": [
        {
          "en": "The news is bad today.",
          "ru": "Новости сегодня плохие."
        },
        {
          "en": "My jeans are too tight.",
          "ru": "Мои джинсы слишком тесные."
        },
        {
          "en": "This series is interesting, but these series are too long.",
          "ru": "Этот сериал интересный, но эти сериалы слишком длинные."
        },
        {
          "en": "Her advice is always useful.",
          "ru": "Ее совет всегда полезен."
        },
        {
          "en": "The police are looking for witnesses.",
          "ru": "Полиция ищет свидетелей."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
